  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Police Records Management Information System Pilot for Dominica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the development and operationalisation of a pilot of the UNDP-developed Police Records management Information System (PRMIS) in Dominica. This intervention will involve the training of police personnel, procurement of necessary ICT hardware, deployment of the PRMIS software, monitoring and evaluation of the pilot and the development of a series of recommendations for scaling of the PRMIS pilot. PRMIS is a web application that allows officers to log, store, and exchange i</narrative>
  </description>
